  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "botchan-s06-p0041",
      "source_en": "We teachers should, on this occasion, reflect on and examine our own conduct so as to help make the discipline of the school better. Therefore, that which both the principal and the dean have just said is good and to the point, and I have the honor of supporting it thoroughly. It is my earnest wish that lenient measures should be taken in dealing with the boys.\" What the artist said had many words, but very little sense. He profusely used classical Chinese words, but what I made out of his speech was only the sentence, \"I support it with all my heart.\"",
